<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield scores on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>In Brisbane: Queensland 244 and 101 for one; Tasmania 168</p>
<p>and 176. Queensland won by nine wickets.</p>
<p>In Sydney (second day) - New South Wales 264 and 174 for</p>
<p>four (Michael Slater 69, Michael Bevan 58 not out); Victoria 161</p>
<p>(Anthony Stuart five for 63).</p>
